  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2024" />
  <Thumbnail>c215e5ae-744c-4b6c-b3a7-0764a04eca4b</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="11-11-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="01-08-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased dimmer wheel resolution.  Added master dimmer and updated cells to use virtual dimmer in response to customer request." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="08-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised Atlabase ID's for 54 + 33 DMX modes in response to customer bug report (2 versions - previously set to 'MS' - unclear what this is)" />
  <History Date="08-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 'Fan Eco' function to control and macros." />
  <History Date="07-11-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
